    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42269" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρείκ-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>heath, Erica arborea,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				295
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				14.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				5.64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.14.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.88
			</span></i>.—The Inscr. quoted 
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρεικόεις</span>
			 proves that <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρείκη</span> is
			correct ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρίκη</span> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ι</span>] is the later spelling, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρείκινος.</span>
			</div>
